		{
			title: "A Vendor Door"
			x: -9.25d
			y: 1.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Vendoor: Capitalism, Ho!"
			description: [
				"&dThere are two kinds of doors that will start spawning in the Vaults after level 20, Bandit."
				""
				"&5Vendoors lead to special rooms that have Vendor Pedestals in them. These doors spawn on the walls inside Vault Rooms, usually on the bottom floor."
				""
				"&dThere's a variety of things the Vendor Pedestals can sell, Bandit, some of them only findable in Vendoor rooms."
				""
				"&5Money is Vault Gold, and the Pedestal will pull it directly from your Wallet or Pouches."
				""
				"&dYou can get a discount on Vendor Pedestals with a certain Expertise."
				""
				"&5Oh! Also, Bandit, keep yer eyes open. Some of the Vendor rooms have some hidden loot in em."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["1881243BF68F0FAC"]
			id: "4905625BD3C4B3C4"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4947C4D29A9DB40A"
				type: "observation"
				title: "Find a Vendoor"
				icon: "the_vault:vendor_door"
				timer: 0L
