		{
			title: "Death In Spirit"
			x: -2.75d
			y: -0.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Body Recovery"
			description: [
				"&dIf you've died in a Vault after hitting level 20, Bandit, no doubt you've found most of your inventory missing and a ghost body spawning where you spawned as well."
				""
				"&5That's yer spirit, Bandit, and if ye want yer inventory back, you'll be wanting to make a Spirit Extractor."
				""
				"&dYou can put your spirit/ghost/body onto a Spirit Extractor, then pay the listed Vault Gold to get your item's back."
				""
				"&5The FOP determine yer body's cost by your equipment, how many bags you have on you, and a few other things."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["2EC8B80AE1A271D5"]
			id: "5A04F0E50CF5F17F"
			tasks: [{
				id: "77F0C183D71F09FA"
