		{
			title: "Guards Guards"
			x: 1.25d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Mini Boss Battles"
			description: [
				"&dOh, while Paradox Vaults are the highlight of what unlocks at 40 for you, Bandit, then at 50 there is another more normal Vault type that unlocks as well : Hunt the Runes."
				""
				"&5These ones are a bit more difficult, Bandit, as ye will be fighting a big Boss type enemy. But to summon this boss, ye'll need to find Runes."
				""
				"&dRunes'll occasionally spawn in chests, and you'll need 5 of them to summon the boss. Each rune'll have a Positive and a Negative effect on them."
				""
				"&5The positive effect'll usually be something like a rare piece of loot. But to get that, ye'll be adding some kind of ability to the Boss. Like a special attack, or more health, etc."
				""
				"&dYou can get a good selection of Runes to build up the Boss how you want. Just take the Runes back to the first room, put them in the Pedestal, and then kill the boss. Easy peasy."
			]
			dependencies: ["391277708CA4B52A"]
			id: "4D05DB966C33B676"
