		{
			title: "Resetting the Paradox"
			x: -0.75d
			y: 1.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Refreshing the Layout"
			description: [
				"&dBandit, if you've gotten unlucky with the room layout of your Divine Paradox vault, or want to choose differently, there IS a way to reset your Divine Paradox."
				""
				"&5It isn't official, though, be warned about that. Ye won't get the money back ye spent on rooms."
				""
				"&dBut sometimes, you gotta start again to come out ahead, yeah?"
				""
				"&5Agreed, sis. Now, Bandit, unsure if ye have come across any...Void themed Vaults yet. They are very dangerous! In fact, the \"End\"  rooms in Raw vaults are also 'Void' rooms."
				""
				"&dBe careful in these Void rooms or vaults. Touching the black water will start sapping your Vault Time quickly!"
				""
				"&5Aye, but bring a bucket! This is the key to resetting the Divine Paradox. Pour it out in the overworld, and throw an Architects' Vault Rock into it!"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
