		}
		{
			title: "Zippity Zap"
			x: -5.25d
			y: -2.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&dYou've definitely noticed that when you roll a new piece of gear, if it has a model you've not seen before, you'll get notified that you've \"unlocked\" it."
				""
				"&5These are Transmogs, and ye can change the model of a piece of gear to a different one ye have unlocked."
				""
				"&dThe neat thing is you can unlock special Transmogs in various ways : researching mods, doing cool things in the Vault, etc."
				""
				"&5What isn't cool, Bandit, is ye can only change an item to the same item type. "
				""
				"&dWhich is silly. We have a special thing in another section that solves this, Bandit~"
