		{
			title: "God Affinity and Reputation"
			x: -4.125d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "The Gods are Fickle"
			description: [
				"&dSo it's important to understand the difference between Affinity and Reputation when it comes to the Gods."
				""
				"&5The FOP made the system a bit...complex. At least to begin with, ye know? Well, we can start with Affinity, sis."
				""
				"&dAffinity is, hm... basicaly showing to one of the four Vault Gods : Idona, Wendarr, Tenos, and Velara."
				""
				"&5The easiest way to do that is to wear one of their Charms, like what we're gonna give ya."
				""
				"&dSo next is Reputation. You see, Bandit, when you complete a God Altar's challenge, you get a buff and sometimes a reward. And a chance at a Reputation point with that God."
				""
				"&5The higher your Affinity, the bigger chance of gaining Reputation. But note ye can only have so much reputation between all the Gods."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["1799D40CDE8D8F82"]
