					tag: { }
				}
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Many Builds"
			x: -2.75d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Swap Like Gear"
			description: [
				"&dBandit, if you want to play around with different builds, the Skill Altar is a must."
				""
				"&5It lets ye save yer Skill and Talents chosen and recall them later, for much less cost of Orb of Regrets."
				""
				"&dA little trick, though. You can load a 'blank' skill set by Importing the following line : "
				""
				"&5Heal_Base:0;Haste:0;Heal_Base|0"
				""
				"&dThe | before the 0 at the end is sometimes called a PIPE. It isn't an i or an L. Hold shift and hit the key marked with \\\\ (on average keyboard)."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["2EC8B80AE1A271D5"]
