			description: [
				"&dNext up, Bandit, is level 50."
				""
				"&5A big stepping stone, aye. A lot opens up to ya. "
				""
				"&dNew vaults, new mechanics, new loot."
				""
				"&5Especially that last one. More treasures."
				""
				"&dYep, but new mechanics also opens up new ways to break into the system more."
				""
				"&5Speaking of, Bandit. Take this Neuralizer. A bit expensive, but its the only way to reset your Expertise points."
				""
				"&dYeah, as you level up, you'll realize some Expertise aren't as useful anymore. I suggest saving it until you are sure you want to reallocate your Expertise points."
