			description: [
				"&dSo, the objective of the Divine Paradox is to collect enough blessings from each God and submitting them in the main room."
				""
				"&5Blessings for a God only drop in rooms dedicated to em. Usually something of the room has that God's color to show you."
				""
				"&dAnd the Blessings come from Chests, Coin Piles, and Ores."
