			description: [
				"&dBandit, the last section of stats for a piece of gear we haven't explained are the Implicits."
				""
				"&5These are the things like Attack Damage, Range, and some special abilities only roll as implicits."
				""
				"&dLike Endergized for Magnets, or Channeling for Tridents."
