			subtitle: "Wax On, Wax Off"
			description: [
				"&dYou should be getting some new Focus' to use in the Vault Artisan Station, Bandit. Like the Waxing and Waning Foci."
				""
				"&5Foci? Focuses? Can never get that straight. But yeah, while the Wild Focus lets you reroll all Prefixes AND Suffixes, these two will let you reroll one or the other."
