		{
			title: "Spooky Door"
			x: -8.25d
			y: 1.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Dungeons of Dread, and More"
			description: [
				"&5There are two kinds of doors that will start spawning in the Vaults after level 20, Bandit."
				""
				"&dDungeon doors can spawn in the walls of Vault Rooms, usually on the bottom floor. They will have the symbol of a specific monster type on them."
				""
				"&5When you open a Dungeon Door, a popup will tell you what difficulty the creatures that spawn inside are."
				""
				"&dThese range from Easy, Normal, Difficult, Challenging, and Impossible."
				""
				"&5Each Dungeon spawns one kind of Barrel, which are alternate versions of Chests, that all act like Wooden Chests. But to break them properly requires the proper tool Affinity."
				""
				"&dAt the end of the Dungeon, it will spawn a special Champion, the boss of the dungeon. It's usually tankier than normal Champions, and drops some decent loot."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["1881243BF68F0FAC"]
