		{
			title: "A Vault Celebration"
			x: -6.25d
			y: -2.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Obvious, It's a Lie"
			description: [
				"&dBandit, keep on the lookout for one of these special Vault Rocks. It's for making a special vault called a Cake Vault."
				""
				"&5Cake Vaults are special, Bandit. The objective is to find as many Cakes as you can. The Rooms in this Vault only have one path : a spiral outward."
				""
				"&dEach room has only one Cake, somewhere. When you get close to it, your vision will change."
				""
				"&5Also in each room is a Crake Pedestal. Don't interact with it until ye are ready to leave!"
				""
				"&dSee, each Cake you find adds modifiers to the Vault. Usually good and bad. More loot, but tougher enemies."
				""
				"&5A good strategy is to go as far as ye can before the enemies get TOO deadly, then loop back and loot before leaving."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
