			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "What's In the Box? Well, What Do You Know?"
			description: [
				"&dBandit, keep an eye out for these little blue boxes. They are called Mod Boxes, and they contain..."
				""
				"&5...different things, depending on what mods ye Researched so far."
				""
				"&dIf you haven't Researched any Mods, the Mod Box will drop Knowledge Shards, to get you closer to Researched a mod. Once you've Researched certain mods, the Mod Box only drops certain items from those Mods."
				""
				"&5Hey, sis. I got an idea. Think you can tweak the boxes a bit so that Bandit still has a chance to get Knowledge Shards?"
				""
				"&dThat's not a bad idea. I'll keep it fairly low chance, cause at a higher level you might not need the Knowledge Shards more than the chance at a high tier Modded item."
