		{
			title: "Cap of the Gods"
			x: -5.25d
			y: -0.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Pray to My Altar"
			description: [
				"&dWhen you complete a God Altar, you will get a bonus modifier to the rest of that Vault, and the chance at gaining reputation with that God."
				""
				"&5But if you remember where that God Altar was, you can return to it to get a prize as well."
				""
				"&dThis is one of the few ways to get a God Capstone. When you add these to a Vault Crystal, they will highlight all altars of that God if you are in the same room as them."
