		{
			title: "Wallhacks"
			x: -4.75d
			y: -1.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Sight Beyond Sight"
			description: [
				"&dOkay, got another special Capstone for you to find, Bandit. It's called the All-Seeing-Eye. This one I was able to seed into Vendoor rooms."
				""
				"&5Hm, by the name, it probably is similar to the Merchant or Dungeon Capstones?"
				""
				"&dYep! All chests, all doors, and all Objective blocks (like the Lodestones or Braziers) will be visible in the same room. And uh....maybe further..."
				""
				"&5Further?!"
				""
				"&dYeah uh it might be a bit highly tuned. You might be able to see into the next room if you are close to the hallway...."
				""
				"&5That's...a lot of things to see at once. I'm getting a headache thinking about it."
			]
